  "pair_quality_note": "Only a minimal_fix pair poses the differential question at all: when the fixed side is a different program (<60% similar) or a large rewrite (>20 changed lines), both sides being flagged is a property of the corpus, not a failure of the model. The headline distinguished_rate is therefore reported over minimal_fix pairs as well as over all pairs.",
